  {"q": "The author's main concern about the broader use of \"keystone species\" is that it ______.", "o": ["is too technical for the public", "has lost explanatory precision", "applies only to predators", "was invented by conservation groups"], "a": 1, "why": "a concept that can include almost anything risks explaining almost nothing——失去了解释力。"},
  {"q": "In the last paragraph, the author responds to the defenders' argument by ______.", "o": ["denying that the term helps conservation", "conceding that the term should be abandoned", "shifting the focus to the term's effect on scientific thinking", "providing new experimental data"], "a": 2, "why": "The objection ... is not that the term is used in public debate but that its looseness can mislead scientists themselves。"},
